WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.202 --> 00:00:09.968
&gt;&gt; Laura: A POLICY PROFESSOR

00:00:09.969 --> 00:00:10.569
IS BLAMING THE TRUMP

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:11.870
ADMINISTRATION FOR CRIME IN

00:00:11.871 --> 00:00:12.204
MEXICO.

00:00:12.205 --> 00:00:15.941
YES, YOU HEARD THAT RIGHT.

00:00:15.942 --> 00:00:17.109
GUADALUPE JOINS US NOW TO

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:17.442
EXPLAIN.

00:00:17.443 --> 00:00:19.011
THANK YOU FOR BEING HERE.

00:00:19.012 --> 00:00:20.979
DO YOU THINK IT'S POSSIBLE THAT

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:21.747
SOME OF THE PEOPLE WHO HAVE BEEN

00:00:21.748 --> 00:00:26.051
DEPORTED BACK TO MEXICO WERE

00:00:26.052 --> 00:00:27.085
ALREADY COMMITTING CRIMES BEFORE

00:00:27.086 --> 00:00:28.453
THEY WERE DEPORTED BACK TO

00:00:28.454 --> 00:00:29.588
MEXICO?

00:00:29.589 --> 00:00:31.189
BECAUSE YOU WERE SAYING

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:33.125
DEPORTATION POLICY IS MAKING

00:00:33.126 --> 00:00:33.692
MEXICO'S LIFE WORSE.

00:00:33.693 --> 00:00:35.193
EXPLAIN.

00:00:35.194 --> 00:00:36.762
&gt;&gt; MEXICO AND THE UNITED STATES

00:00:36.763 --> 00:00:37.996
BECAUSE PEOPLE ARE VERY

00:00:37.997 --> 00:00:38.764
VULNERABLE.

00:00:38.765 --> 00:00:40.766
WE HAVE CARTELS AT THE BORDER,

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:41.800
OPERATING AT THE BORDER.

00:00:41.801 --> 00:00:43.769
WE HAVE CORRUPTION IN MEXICO,

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:45.904
THEREFORE, WHEN YOU DEPORT

00:00:45.905 --> 00:00:49.007
PEOPLE TO THE BORDER, THEY FIND

00:00:49.008 --> 00:00:50.976
THEMSELVES LIKE THEY WANT TO

00:00:50.977 --> 00:00:52.377
COME BACK TO THE UNITED STATES.

00:00:52.378 --> 00:00:53.111
THEY DON'T HAVE THEIR FAMILIES

00:00:53.112 --> 00:00:55.881
AND SOME OF THEM ARE FORCED TO

00:00:55.882 --> 00:00:57.582
PARTICIPATE IN CRIMINAL

00:00:57.583 --> 00:00:58.550
ACTIVITIES, OR SOME OF THEM WANT

00:00:58.551 --> 00:01:01.653
TO GO TO THE UNITED STATES SO

00:01:01.654 --> 00:01:03.822
THEY HIRED SOME SMUGGLERS THAT

00:01:03.823 --> 00:01:05.557
ARE IN AN ACTION WITH THE

00:01:05.558 --> 00:01:05.891
CARTEL.

00:01:05.892 --> 00:01:06.792
&gt;&gt; Laura: I UNDERSTAND THAT.

00:01:06.793 --> 00:01:08.360
BUT WHY IS THAT OUR PROBLEM?

00:01:08.361 --> 00:01:12.864
&gt;&gt; WELL, IT'S NOT YOUR PROBLEM

00:01:12.865 --> 00:01:15.367
BUT YOU MIGHT HAVE A PROBLEM, AS

00:01:15.368 --> 00:01:15.667
WELL.

00:01:15.668 --> 00:01:19.971
BECAUSE YOU HAVE MORE CRIMINAL

00:01:19.972 --> 00:01:21.106
GROUPS OPERATING ON THE SIDE OF

00:01:21.107 --> 00:01:22.174
THE MEXICO BORDER.

00:01:22.175 --> 00:01:24.743
AS YOU KNOW, PEOPLE ARE STILL

00:01:24.744 --> 00:01:25.510
ARRIVING IN THE UNITED STATES NO

00:01:25.511 --> 00:01:25.911
MATTER WHAT.

00:01:25.912 --> 00:01:27.379
&gt;&gt; Laura: DO YOU THINK WE

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.581
SHOULD HAVE ANY BORDERS, REALLY?

00:01:29.582 --> 00:01:31.550
WHY HAVE A BORDER AT THIS POINT?

00:01:31.551 --> 00:01:36.488
WHY NOT MAKE IT ALL ONE MEXICO

00:01:36.489 --> 00:01:37.689
AND UNITED STATES AND THE CARTEL

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:39.958
WILL KIND OF GO OUT OF BUSINESS?

00:01:39.959 --> 00:01:41.426
WE WILL BE ALL ONE COUNTRY.

00:01:41.427 --> 00:01:42.994
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE ANY COUNTRY HAS TO

00:01:42.995 --> 00:01:44.362
HAVE SOME KIND OF LIMITS, AND I

00:01:44.363 --> 00:01:46.631
THINK BORDERS ARE IMPORTANT TO

00:01:46.632 --> 00:01:48.733
HAVE LIMITS.

00:01:48.734 --> 00:01:50.068
&gt;&gt; Laura: BUT IF YOU CAN HAVE

00:01:50.069 --> 00:01:51.203
A BORDER, PRESUMABLY WHEN PEOPLE

00:01:51.204 --> 00:01:53.772
DON'T HAVE PERMISSION TO BE

00:01:53.773 --> 00:01:55.774
HERE, THEN THEY CAN BE SENT

00:01:55.775 --> 00:01:56.074
HOME.

00:01:56.075 --> 00:01:57.209
EVERY COUNTRY ON THE FACE OF THE

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:58.276
PLANET SEND PEOPLE HOME WHEN

00:01:58.277 --> 00:02:00.579
THEY DON'T HAVE PERMISSION, AND

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:01.580
ESPECIALLY IF THEY HAVE

00:02:01.581 --> 00:02:02.781
COMMITTED A CRIME.

00:02:02.782 --> 00:02:03.982
THEN YOU'RE REALLY SUBJECTING

00:02:03.983 --> 00:02:04.783
THEM TO DEPORTATION.

00:02:04.784 --> 00:02:06.685
I THINK AMERICANS DON'T FEEL

00:02:06.686 --> 00:02:07.786
LIKE IT'S THEIR RESPONSIBILITY

00:02:07.787 --> 00:02:09.287
TO MAKE SURE -- WE WANT MEXICO

00:02:09.288 --> 00:02:11.189
TO BE WELL, BUT WE DON'T WANT

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:12.591
PEOPLE TO CROSS THE BORDER.

00:02:12.592 --> 00:02:13.992
IT REAL QUICK.

00:02:13.993 --> 00:02:17.063
&gt;&gt; I THINK YOU'RE RIGHT BUT AT

